  "summary": "The experiment tested a baseline multimodal setup using PCA (n=2000) for RNA and ResNet50 for images with concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, but it remains unclear whether this outperforms single-modality baselines or if the fusion strategy significantly impacts results. Further experiments are needed to isolate these factors."
